---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="StayJustIn | West Covina News, City Hall Updates & Development"
  description="StayJustIn covers West Covina City Hall, local news, development projects, public safety updates, business changes, events, and community issues explained simply."
  canonical="https://www.stayjustin.com/"
>
  <section class="news-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">West Covina in simple terms</span>
      <h1>What’s Happening in West Covina Right Now</h1>
      <p>
        Clear updates on City Hall, development, budgets, public safety, and local issues —
        explained without the noise.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

<p class="article-principle">
  <span>“Speak up for those who cannot speak for themselves.”</span><br />
  <strong>— Proverbs 31:8</strong>
</p>

  <section class="featured-section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="featured-card">
        <span class="featured-badge">Featured</span>
        <h2>
          <a href="/city-hall/april-21-2026-city-council-budget-questions/">
            West Covina’s Latest Council Packet Raises Budget Questions Residents Should Watch
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p>
          Emergency repairs, overtime spending, labor costs, and the mid-year financial report
          all point to bigger questions about oversight and follow-through.
        </p>
        <a class="read-more" href="/city-hall/april-21-2026-city-council-budget-questions/">
          Read the full breakdown →
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header clean-header">
        <div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Latest City Hall Stories</h2>
          <p class="section-sub">The main issues residents should be watching.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="view-all" href="/city-hall/">View City Hall</a>
      </div>

      <div class="story-grid">
        <article class="story-card">
          <span class="story-tag">Fire Station 3</span>
          <h3>
            <a href="/city-hall/fire-station-3-emergency-repairs-continue/">
              Fire Station 3 emergency repairs continue
            </a>
          </h3>
          <p>
            The city is being asked to continue emergency authority after rodent infestation repairs.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="story-card">
          <span class="story-tag">Overtime</span>
          <h3>
            <a href="/city-hall/west-covina-overtime-spending-analysis/">
              Overtime spending is already over 50% at mid-year
            </a>
          </h3>
          <p>
            Police and fire overtime are the numbers residents should watch closely.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="story-card">
          <span class="story-tag">Budget</span>
          <h3>
            <a href="/city-hall/west-covina-q2-financial-report-2025-26/">
              West Covina Q2 financial report explained
            </a>
          </h3>
          <p>
            Mid-year numbers show revenue and spending moving at different speeds.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="story-card">
          <span class="story-tag">Labor</span>
          <h3>
            <a href="/city-hall/west-covina-fire-management-mou-2024-2028/">
              Fire Management MOU: what it costs over time
            </a>
          </h3>
          <p>
            A new agreement creates public safety labor costs through 2028.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="topics-section section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header clean-header">
        <div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Explore West Covina Topics</h2>
          <p class="section-sub">Jump into the main sections of the site.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="topics-grid">
        <a href="/city-hall/" class="topic-card">
          <span>🏛️</span>
          <strong>City Hall</strong>
        </a>

        <a href="/west-covina-news/" class="topic-card">
          <span>📰</span>
          <strong>West Covina News</strong>
        </a>

        <a href="/development/" class="topic-card">
          <span>🏗️</span>
          <strong>Development</strong>
        </a>

        <a href="/traffic-road-closures/" class="topic-card">
          <span>🚧</span>
          <strong>Traffic road closures</strong>
        </a>

        <a href="/events/" class="topic-card">
          <span>📅</span>
          <strong>Events</strong>
        </a>

        <a href="/new-businesses/" class="topic-card">
          <span>🏪</span>
          <strong>New Business</strong>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bottom-links-section">
    <div class="container bottom-links-card">
      <h2>More From StayJustIn</h2>
      <p>
        Helpful links, local resources, and ways to follow or contact the site.
      </p>

      <div class="bottom-link-list">
        <a href="/tech-help/">Tech Help</a>
        <a href="/contact/">Send a Tip</a>
        <a href="https://stayjustin.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Subscribe on Substack
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
